  "description": "Modern 3-Bed Home — Ballinglanna, Glanmire, Cork\n\nOverview / Description:\n\nA beautifully presented, near-new three-bedroom home to rent in the highly sought-after Ballinglanna development in Glanmire, Co. Cork. Built just two years ago and finished to a high standard throughout, this is an ideal home for a family seeking modern, move-in-ready accommodation in one of Cork's most desirable locations.\n\nThe property extends to 102 m² of bright, contemporary living space, comprising three well-proportioned bedrooms (2 double, 1 single), two bathrooms and a guest WC, south facing garden. It's A-rated energy efficiency and excellent insulation keep running costs low and the home warm year-round.\n\nBallinglanna is a thriving, family-friendly community just a short drive from Cork city centre, with excellent access to the M8/N8 motorway network. Local schools, shops, and amenities are all close by, offering the perfect balance of village charm and city convenience.\n\nFeatures:\n\n-Near-new build (approx. 2 years old)\n-3 bedrooms (2 double, 1 single)\n-2 bathrooms plus guest WC\n-102 m² of contemporary living space\n-A-rated BER — low running costs\n-High-quality finishes throughout\n-Excellent insulation\n-2 Parking spaces\n-Private rear garden (south facing)\n-Sought-after Ballinglanna development\n-Minutes from M8/N8 and Cork city\n-Close to schools, shops and amenities\n\nViewing: By appointment — early viewing recommended.",
